          Society of the State of Pennsylvania.
        </strong>{" "}
        <em>Transactions of the Homoeopathic
        Medical Society of the State of Pennsylvania</em>.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

  </div>

  <p>
    These are historical reports assembled by the profession itself,
